\pard\plain \s61\li360\sa60\sb30\qj\widctlpar\qj\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Perform set boot mode operation\par
User can call this function only after CRRM init has been done.\par
Get CRRM handle before calling this API.\par
This API set the boot mode information in the BBSM. It is used by the recovery OS to request a mode transition. Only specific transitions are accepted, others are ignored. Accepted transitions are:\par
Recovery download -> recovery install (after recovery image successfully downloaded)\par
Recovery install -> normal (after recovery image successfully installed)\par
Recovery install -> recovery download (encountered error in recovery image install)\par
Only one transition can be requested per boot cycle.\par
