\pard\plain \s61\li360\sa60\sb30\qj\widctlpar\qj\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Perform refresh AWDT operation\par
User can call this function only after CRRM init has been done.\par
Get CRRM handle before calling this API.\par
This API is used to refresh the specified AWDT.\par
The message contains a signature, that is calculated over the concatenation of the following information:\par
1: word 1 of the message below (pub key index and timer ID)\par
2: the newTimerValue from the request structure\par
3: current nonce value for the requested timer\par
4: timer info for the requested timer if present\par
If the signature is valid, the corresponding AWDT timer is refreshed\par
{{\s5\sb90\sa30\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\fs20\cgrid 
Parameters\par}
